        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Passage Function Miami Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a  Passage Function Lever (Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6300 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a> and PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300v605\"><b>6300 Series Surface Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-s-08-phl\"><b>Classroom Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-s-09-phl\"><b>Storeroom Function Lever for 6300 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPDQ Miami style lever with round rose. Packaged with mounting hardware and instructions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-S-14-PHL Passage Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage Function (ANSI F14) - Entry by Outside lever - Always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
